          "comment": "[Playbook] We have added a standalone Company right to terminate for convenience on 90 days' notice (so the exit is not read as mere non-renewal) and limited HDI's Section 4.1 termination to the end of the then-current term, and we have capped the Termination Payment at three months of the amounts payable to HDI under Section 3.",
